l LGA 2011-V3</li>\n                  <li>Chipset: Intel C612</li>\n                  <li>Processor Support: Intel Xeon E5-2600 V3 &amp; V4 Series</li>\n                  <li>Memory Slots: 4 × DDR3 DIMM</li>\n                  <li>Maximum Memory: Up to 128GB</li>\n                  <li>Memory Support: ECC Registered / Non-ECC DDR3</li>\n                  <li>Storage: 2 × M.2 NVMe, 6 × SATA III</li>\n                  <li>Expansion Slots: PCIe x16, PCIe x4, PCIe x1</li>\n                  <li>Network: Gigabit Ethernet</li>\n                  <li>USB Ports: USB 3.0 &amp; USB 2.0</li>\n                  <li>Audio: HD Audio</li>\n                  <li>Form Factor: Micro-ATX</li>\n                  <li>Warranty: 01 Year</li>\n              </ul>\n</div>\n\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"block-footer\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#\">View Details</a></div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n      </div>\n                    </div>\n</div>\n\n                  </div>\n                              </div>\n            </div>\n                  </div>\n                      </div>\n      </div>\n\n                                </div>\n                                                </div>","blocksHtml":"<div class=\"product-blocks blocks-default\">\n            <div class=\"product-blocks-default product-blocks-416 grid-rows\">\n          <div class=\"grid-row grid-row-416-1\">\n                <div class=\"grid-cols\">\n                      <div class=\"grid-col grid-col-416-1-1\">\n              <div class=\"grid-items\">\n                                  <div class=\"grid-item grid-item-416-1-1-1\">\n                    <div class=\"module module-blocks module-blocks-417 blocks-tabs\">\n    <div class=\"module-body\">\n                <div class=\"tabs-container\">\n      <ul class=\"nav nav-tabs\">\n                  <li class=\"tab-2 active\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-1\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Description</a>\n                      </li>\n                  <li class=\"tab-4\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Product Table</a>\n                      </li>\n                  <li class=\"tab-5\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-3\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Video</a>\n                      </li>\n                  <li class=\"tab-6\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-4\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Review</a>\n                      </li>\n              </ul>\n      <div class=\"tab-content\">\n                              <div class=\"module-item module-item-2 tab-pane active\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-1\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-description\">\n                <p>The X99-XD3 Intel LGA 2011-V3 Server Motherboard is a dependable Micro-ATX platform built around the Intel C612 server chipset, making it an excellent choice for enterprise servers, virtualization systems, professional workstations, and high-performance computing. Designed to support Intel Xeon E5-2600 V3 and V4 processors, this motherboard delivers stable, multi-core performance for demanding business and productivity workloads.</p><p>Featuring four DDR3 DIMM slots with support for up to 128GB of quad-channel memory, the X99-XD3 is compatible with ECC Registered Server RAM, providing improved reliability for continuous 24/7 operation. Whether you're building a virtualization server, NAS, rendering workstation, or engineering system, this motherboard offers the performance and stability professionals need.</p><p>For storage, the motherboard includes dual M.2 slots (NVMe support) alongside 6 SATA III ports, allowing users to install high-speed SSDs and large-capacity HDDs simultaneously. Expansion options include PCIe x16, PCIe x4, and PCIe x1 slots, making it easy to add GPUs, RAID controllers, high-speed networking cards, or other expansion devices. Additional features such as Gigabit Ethernet, USB 3.0, USB 2.0, and HD Audio ensure broad compatibility with modern peripherals.</p><p>If you're looking for an affordable yet powerful Intel Xeon server motherboard in Bangladesh, the X99-XD3 offers excellent value for IT professionals, businesses, and enthusiasts. Buy the genuine X99-XD3 motherboard from D CORE with competitive pricing and trusted after-sales support.</p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features</h3><p><br></p><ul><li>Model: X99-XD3</li><li>Intel C612 Server Chipset</li><li>Intel LGA 2011-V3 Socket</li><li>Supports Intel Xeon E5-2600 V3 &amp; V4 Processors</li><li>4 × DDR3 DIMM Slots (Up to 128GB)</li><li>Supports ECC Registered &amp; Non-ECC DDR3 Memory</li><li>Quad-Channel Memory Architecture</li><li>2 × M.2 Slots (NVMe Support)</li><li>6 × SATA III (6Gb/s) Ports</li><li>1 × PCIe x16 Slot</li><li>1 × PCIe x4 Slot</li><li>1 × PCIe x1 Slot</li><li>Gigabit LAN (Realtek RTL8111H)</li><li>USB 3.0 &amp; USB 2.0 Connectivity</li><li>TPM Header &amp; M.2 Wi-Fi Slot</li><li>Micro-ATX Form Factor</li></ul>\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-4 tab-pane\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-dynamic\">\n                <div class=\"module-compatibility-table\" id=\"tab-compatibility\">\n            <h3>Product List</h3>\n        <div class=\"module-compatibility-table-content\">\n      \n        <div class=\"table-responsive\">\n          <table class=\"table table-bordered\">\n            <thead>\n                <tr>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><strong></strong></td>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-price\"><strong>Price</strong></td>\n                </tr>\n            </t